sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Core/T1 L1
    participant M as T1 Mux
    participant H as T0 Home L2
    participant N1 as T1 NIC/Router
    participant N0 as T0 NIC/Router
    participant MEM as Memory tap
    C->>M: Load address 0x80
    M->>H: GETS(addr=0x80), home bank from Addr[5:4]
    H->>H: L2_COMPARE: directory miss
    H->>N0: NMSG_MEM_REQ(dest=MEM_ID)
    N0->>MEM: Memory request packet
    MEM-->>N0: NMSG_MEM_DATA(data)
    N0-->>H: Fill data
    H->>H: Allocate DIR_E, owner=T1
    H-->>N0: NMSG_DATA(dest=T1, exclusive=1)
    N0-->>N1: Ring forwarding
    N1-->>M: Data + exclusive indication
    M-->>C: Fill L1 as EXCLUSIVE
    Note over H,C: Controller progression: IDLE → COMPARE → ALLOCATE → DONE